      "expected": "At least one frozen/relaxed host contrast and one actual solvent/counterion sensitivity must challenge the interpretation. Do not use PSS as Boltzmann population. Core rows: frozen_host, solvent_or_ion_pair. Recompute primary_contrast_kJ_mol, control_contrast_kJ_mol, change_kJ_mol from the submitted linked raw outputs and numeric tables. No narrative-only control or reused old scalar receives endpoint credit.",
